DESCRIPTION:Venue: 53 Rue Notre Dame des Champs\, 75006 Paris\n✨ Movie Ni
 ght with Erasmus Paris x Lost in Frenchlation! ✨ Do you love films? Then
  come and join us for a special screening of a true French comedy classic:
  Astérix & Obélix: Mission Cléopâtre Plot: The Egyptian Queen Cleopatr
 a bets against the Roman Emperor\, Julius Caesar\, that her people are sti
 ll great\, even if the times of the Pharaohs has long passed. She vows (ag
 ainst all logic) to build a new palace for Caesar within three months. Sin
 ce all her architects are either busy otherwise or too conservative in sty
 le\, this ambivalent honor falls to Edifis. He is to build the palace and 
 be covered in gold or\, if not\, his fate is to be eaten by crocodiles. Do
 n’t miss this chance to discover a French classic with English subtitles
 \, meet new people\, and share a magical evening together! Tuesday\, Octob
 er 27 7:00 PM Lucernaire : 53 Rue Notre Dame des Champs 75006 Paris\n\nhtt
