 llence. From its lavish decorations to the mythical tales of the Phantom o
 f the Opera\, every corner of the Palais Garnier is steeped in history Exp
 lore this architectural masterpiece\, marvel at its majestic grand stairca
 se\, opulent foyers\, and the world-famous auditorium with us! ❤️ Date
